      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">头寸大小和手数大小有什么区别？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7579b9f89149b258",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Position size tells you how much of an instrument you are trading, while lot size expresses that position using the platform's contract-size convention.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">头寸大小告诉您正在交易的工具的数量，而手数大小则使用平台的合约大小约定来表示该头寸。</span>"
    },
