    {
      "key": "tcd46694bb4c1b831",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For EUR/USD in a USD-denominated account, one unit has a pip value of approximately $0.0001 for a standard four-decimal pip.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">对于以美元计价的账户中的欧元/美元，对于标准的四位小数点来说，一个单位的点值约为 0.0001 美元。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbc637aec44a23514",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">That shortcut works because USD is the pair's quote currency and also the account currency. If the quote currency does not match the account currency, as can happen with cross pairs, the pip value normally requires an additional currency-conversion step.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">该快捷方式之所以有效，是因为美元是货币对的报价货币，也是账户货币。如果报价货币与账户货币不匹配（交叉货币对可能会发生这种情况），则点值通常需要额外的货币转换步骤。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9599fee53a6de3f1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">JPY pairs also use a different convention: one pip is typically the second decimal place rather than the fourth, so the pip value per unit must be calculated using that pricing format.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size:-formula,-lot-size-&-risk-examples#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-calculate-forex-position-size-formula-lot-size-risk-examples"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">日元对也使用不同的约定：一个点通常是小数点后第二位而不是第四位，因此每单位的点值必须使用该定价格式来计算。</span>"
    },
